Package: exwin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: exwin maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 gir1.2-adw-1,
 python3-tomli-w
Recommends: innoextract,
 winetricks,
 unar,
 cabextract,
 mangohud,
 gamemode,
 gamescope
Suggests: p7zip-full,
 fuseiso,
 udisks2,
 power-profiles-daemon
Homepage: https://github.com/anthropics/exwin
Description: Offline Windows software/game manager for Linux
 exwin is a GTK4/libadwaita application that manages Windows games and
 applications on Linux using Proton or Wine. It provides first-class
 support for offline GOG installers, archive-based installs
 (ZIP/7z/RAR), MSI packages, and generic Wine-installer executables.
 .
 Features include per-app Wine prefixes, DXVK/VKD3D-Proton setup,
 winetricks verb picker, ProtonDB tier lookup, gamescope compositor
 integration, save-file backup/restore, and a persistent library
 database with playtime tracking.
